flowchart TD
    A[Signal source] --> B{Source type}
    B -->|Dashboard scan| C[POST /signals/scan]
    B -->|Customer complaint or escalation| D[Conversation-to-signal bridge]
    B -->|Manual API request| E[POST /signals]

    C --> F[Renewal-risk and low-health detectors]
    F --> G[Signal payload]
    D --> G
    E --> G

    G --> H[Start Temporal ProcessSignalWorkflow]
    H --> I[record_signal_queued activity]
    I --> J[Normalize payload and calculate dedupe key]
    J --> K[Persist signal as queued]
    K --> L[mark_signal_processing activity]
    L --> M[process_signal activity]

    M --> N[SignalOrchestrator]
    N --> O[Load tenant config, constraints, customer memory]
    O --> P[Signal planner]
    P --> Q[Build dependency-aware plan]

    Q --> R[DelegationManager]
    R --> S[Health analysis task]
    R --> T[Playbook retrieval task]
    S --> U[Outreach draft task]
    T --> U

    S --> V[ReAct tool use: query health]
    T --> W[Retrieval optimization]
    W --> W1[LLM query rewrite]
    W1 --> W2[Parallel pgvector playbook recall]
    W2 --> W3[Merge/dedupe and LLM rerank]
    U --> X[Draft results]

    X --> Y[ComplianceCriticAgent]
    Y --> Z{Approved?}
    Z -->|No| ZA[Retry plan once with stricter compliance constraint]
    ZA --> Y
    Z -->|Yes| ZB[Finalize decision]

    ZB --> ZC[Update customer signal profile]
    ZC --> ZD{Approved external write?}
    ZD -->|Yes| ZE[Persist action approval]
    ZE --> ZF[Execute MCP action through tool gateway]
    ZF --> ZG[Email provider / CSM notification]
    ZD -->|No| ZH[Skip external action]
    ZG --> ZI[mark_signal_done activity]
    ZH --> ZI
    ZI --> ZJ[Persist final signal result]

    M -. Temporal retries .-> M
    N -. telemetry .-> ZK[Structured logs + optional Langfuse / OpenTelemetry]
    R -. role success and latency .-> ZL[PerformanceMonitor]
    ZL -. routing penalties .-> R

    classDef async fill:#FFF3CD,stroke:#856404,color:#111;
    classDef safety fill:#F8D7DA,stroke:#842029,color:#111;
    classDef storage fill:#D1E7DD,stroke:#0F5132,color:#111;
    classDef external fill:#CFE2FF,stroke:#084298,color:#111;
    class H,M async;
    class Y,ZA,ZE safety;
    class K,ZI,ZJ storage;
    class ZF,ZG external;
